00:40:11.250 --> 00:40:17.210
For me, as like a TV showrunner and Carter too, like this feeling of like, we get to keep doing this.
对我来说，作为一名电视节目制作人，卡特也是，这种感觉就像是，我们还能继续做这个。

00:40:17.210 --> 00:40:21.650
we get to keep doing this and it's expansive and it's not ending anytime soon.
我们还能继续做这个，而且它在不断扩展，不会很快结束。

00:40:21.650 --> 00:40:27.849
And I just, I remember feeling so full of hope and gratitude and really this love for the show.
我记得当时感到充满了希望和感激，真的对这部剧充满了爱。

00:40:27.849 --> 00:40:33.610
I feel this great, when you cut to black off of in the middle of that sentence, which is what a great cliffhanger.
我觉得这很棒，当你在那句话中间切成黑屏时，那真是一个很棒的悬念。

00:40:33.610 --> 00:40:36.449
It's a season-long cliffhanger in the middle of a sentence.
