00:54:13.329 --> 00:54:41.939
A show that is people's comfort show where we said the characters themselves are not comfortable a lot, but there's something comfortable about watching a show of watching people at this very tender, unformed, confusing time of life, struggle and stumble and have set back and failure and victory and success and triumph and all the things and people say when they encounter their own struggle and their own setback, they say, oh, this is just part of a grander design.
这是一部人们的慰藉之剧，虽然我们说过角色本身并不总是感到舒适，但观看一部关于人们在人生中这个非常脆弱、未成形、令人困惑的时期，挣扎、跌倒、经历挫折、失败、胜利、成功、成就以及所有这一切的剧，有一种慰藉感，当人们遇到自己的挣扎和挫折时，他们会说，哦，这只是宏大设计的一部分。

00:54:41.939 --> 00:54:45.905
This is all part of something that these characters went through.
