00:54:45.905 --> 00:54:58.410
It's archetypal, it's a rite of passage to stumble and feel your way around in the dark and be lost and infused and think things are going one way and they go another, but it turns out to be the right way.
这是原型，是在黑暗中摸索、感到迷茫、困惑，以为事情会朝一个方向发展，结果却朝另一个方向发展，但最终证明是正确方向的必经之路。

00:54:58.410 --> 00:55:14.210
I just think I think we gave people a roadmap for a kind of sane way to live a life, a way to have life, have a kind of meaning and a roadmap that I think is really was a, it kind of makes it sound drier than it is, but it was a good public service, you know?
我只是觉得，我们为人们提供了一份关于如何理智生活的路线图，一种拥有生活、拥有某种意义的方式，这份路线图虽然听起来比实际要枯燥，但它确实是一项很好的公共服务，你懂吗？

